{31}{I am here as a representative of the family.}{}{5}{}{40}{ }
{32}{I am here as a representative of the Industrial Council.}{}{5}{ps4}{60}{ }
{40}{[He leans forward.] As I said, what of it?}{[He leans forward.] As I said, what of it?}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{I think you should return ownership of the mine to them.}{}{5}{}{50}{ }
{50}{Hah! Why should I do that? I paid that little weasel good money for his worthless mine! Unless...you were planning on making it worth my while?}{Hah! Why should I do that? I paid that little weasel good money for his worthless mine! Unless...you were planning on making it worth my while?}{}{}{}{ }
