{70}{[He begins to look a bit worried, and then shakes it off.] What kind of "irregularities"? I bought that mine with good coin!}{[He begins to look a bit worried, and then shakes it off.] What kind of "irregularities"? I bought that mine with good coin!}{}{}{}{ }
