{81}{Your excuses aren't convincing me.}{}{5}{lf2 0}{160}{lf2 1 }
{82}{There seems to be some question as to whether it was his to sell.}{}{5}{}{90}{ }
{83}{Your excuses aren't convincing me.}{}{5}{lf2 1}{150}{lf4 1, re-10 }
{90}{Hey, wait a minute! As I said, I paid good coin for that mine! It isn't my fault he wasn't on the level with me!}{Hey, wait a minute! As I said, I paid good coin for that mine! It isn't my fault he wasn't on the level with me!}{}{}{}{ }
{92}{Of course. You wouldn't mind appearing in court as a witness?}{}{5}{}{-4}{ }
